WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.020
(audience cheers)
- Alright, we always

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.760
like to wrap things up with something

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.980
that could add a little
joy to your day possibly.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.253
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.253 --> 00:00:09.510
(upbeat music)
(audience cheers)

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.280
Here's a little something for any of you

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.480
who get down at times,

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.760
thinking that love might
never come your way.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.280
Just check out these newlyweds.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.700
That's 93 year old Robert,
and 88 year old Anne.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.710
They were both widowed years ago,

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.900
and never expected to marry again.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.982
But then get this, I love
that they met on Match.com,

00:00:28.982 --> 00:00:30.000
(audience chuckles) which is awesome.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.560
Just looking for companionship,

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.660
and they recently told People Magazine,

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.790
It was head-over-heels
love at first sight.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:36.960
I love this story.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.640
We have these two on the line right now

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.860
watching on NBC4, New York.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:42.853
Hello Anne! (audience cheers)

00:00:42.853 --> 00:00:43.686
Hello, Robert!

00:00:43.686 --> 00:00:44.673
- Hello, Kelly.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:49.072
- Oh my god, y'all look
great, but congratulations!

00:00:49.072 --> 00:00:50.970
(audience cheers)
I understand the wedding was

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:53.070
super special, right?

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.320
- Definitely. Yes, yes.
- It was,

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.230
- So people are looking
to you as inspiration

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:00.690
that it's never too late
to find love, fall in love.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:02.490
So how does that feel?

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:05.640
- Gee, to be a model like that?

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:09.930
It feels like a big
responsibility, but a happy one.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.780
I think the message I
would have in that regard,

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:17.550
stay at it, keep working at,
at Match.com or whatever.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:20.797
It took me, I don't, hundreds of hours,

00:01:20.797 --> 00:01:25.230
(both laugh) and so many
dates and phone calls.

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:30.230
So, stay with it and
you'll find your love too.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:31.628
- [Kelly] Oh my,
- Don't give up the ship.

00:01:31.628 --> 00:01:32.461
- I love it!

00:01:32.461 --> 00:01:33.694
How about you, Anne?

00:01:33.694 --> 00:01:35.760
- [Robert] I,
- Same thing?

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.060
- I hadn't even thought
about the inspiration.

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.470
My daughter thought it would be nice

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:43.080
if I'd find somebody to,
I was living with her,

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:46.380
find somebody else to talk to
besides her. (Anne chuckles)

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.870
So she said, Why don't
you go on Match.com?

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:50.190
I said, Okay.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:53.070
It didn't take me very long because he, I,

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.190
he came buzzing through
and when I saw him,

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:59.280
I fell in love right, right on sight.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.200
And it was, it was magical.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.000
So that was the beginning.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.920
Right? Love at first sight.
- I,

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:07.740
- And that should be an
inspiration to everybody.

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:12.373
- I too, the moment I saw
her, her photo, I was,

00:02:12.373 --> 00:02:14.040
I knew I had to have that woman.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:14.873
- Yeah.
(audience awws)

00:02:14.873 --> 00:02:17.250
- Oh my gosh!

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:20.430
- This is my favorite one
I'm liking, oh my god.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.140
Thank you so much, Anne.

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:23.640
Thank you, Robert.
(audience claps)

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:27.547
Congratulations! I'm
liking your post right now.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:28.710
(heart dings)
(audience continues clapping)

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:29.820
And that's not all.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.680
Our season-long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:34.950
makers of G2, the go to pen
of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:38.670
want to honor truly unstoppable
people just like y'all,

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.410
embracing every moment of life.

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:44.143
So they're gonna be writing
you a check for $1000.

00:02:44.143 --> 00:02:45.863
(audience cheers)
Just have a good time.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.300
Oh my gosh, I love you both so much!

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.906
Thank you for taking the
time to be on our show!

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:54.840
(audience continues cheering)

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.970
And thank you to all our guests today.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:03:00.150
Lena Dunham, Fortune Feimster, Ally Al,

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.460
Dr. Kathie-Ann Joseph, and Emily Kaufman,

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:03.293
y'all have a great day.

00:03:03.293 --> 00:03:05.150
And if it's not, well try and change it.

